{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13534","headline":"神仙 · 张彪","name":"神仙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"神仙可学无，百岁名大约。\n天地何苍茫，人间半哀乐。\n浮生亮多惑，善事翻爲恶。\n争先等驰驱，中路苦瘦弱。\n长老思养寿，後生笑寂寞。\n五谷非长年，四气乃灵药。\n列子何必待，吾心满寥廓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张彪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13534.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13534","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}